@ddd.domain-service

Purpose:
  Domain operation that does not naturally belong to an entity/value object.

UseWhen:
  - operation spans multiple aggregates
  - no natural owner exists
  - domain logic without state

AvoidWhen:
  - operation belongs to a single entity
  - stateless orchestration (use application service)

Why:
  Prevents forcing domain logic into entities where it does not belong.

Related:
  @ddd.entity
  @ddd.aggregate

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
